### 5. thermodynamics on device -- what blocks it ###
  TotalEnergyState holds SensibleEnthalpy holds TemperatureDependentProperty, which is
  std::vector-backed and therefore HOST ONLY. But the recovery this solver uses is a CLOSED
  FORM, so only scalars are needed on device:
    120:  const Real temperature = (specificInternalEnergy - hRef + cp * tRef) / cv;
    171:  out.pressure = thermo_.equationOfState().pressure(density, out.temperature);
  std::vector occurrences in TotalEnergy.hpp (why it cannot cross to device as-is):
    0

